 class="digest_more_arrow"></div></a><div class="dl_content"><div class="dl_tab_ct " style="display:none"><div class="fc_tab active">Top News</div><div class="fc_tab ">Overview</div><div class="fc_tab ">Reactions and opinions</div></div><div class="right_arrow"><div class="arrow_img"></div></div><div class="left_arrow hide"><div class="arrow_img"></div></div><div class="fc_cal_ct"><div class="fc_cal"><div class="fc_cal_item fc_largeleft"><a class="ns-hero-link largeleft" url="https://allhiphop.com/news/bill-gates-thinks-ai-could-kill-a-billion-people-without-regulation/" target="_blank" aria-label="Bill Gates Thinks AI Could Kill A Billion People Without Regulation" href="https://allhiphop.com/news/bill-gates-thinks-ai-could-kill-a-billion-people-without-regulation/" h="ID=news,5093.1"><div class="hero-img"><div class="citm_img" style="height: 200px;" tabindex="-1"><img tabindex="-1" data-src-hq="/th?id=ONUT.PDu_sxM_q4DCGn5cFxipiA&amp;pid=News&amp;w=367&amp;h=200&amp;c=14&amp;rs=2&amp;qlt=90" data-priority="2" title="Bill Gates Thinks AI Could Kill A Billion People Without Regulation" width="367" height="200" id="emb5073DF06" class="rms_img" loading="lazy" src="/th?id=ONUT.PDu_sxM_q4DCGn5cFxipiA&pid=News&w=367&h=200&c=14&rs=2&qlt=30" /></div></div><div class="word-part"><div class="publisher-part"><div class="big_logo"><div class="big_pub_logo ns_pub_area cap_top" data-priority="2"><cite title="AllHipHop"><div class="caption_img"><img title="AllHipHop" width="81" height="12" class="pubimg rms_img" id="emb104961483" loading="lazy" src="/th?id=OJ.ua0uaRlABaecoQ&pid=news&w=81&h=12&rs=2" /></div><span class="cap_txt">&nbsp;&#0183;&#32;7h</span></cite></div></div></div><div class="na_t news_title">Bill Gates Thinks AI Could Kill A Billion People Without Regulation</div><div class="key-point">Bill Gates warns that unregulated AI could orchestrate events killing a billion people, demanding government regulation.</div><div class="fc_prompt"><div class="bottom_chevron_bac"></div><p>Continue reading</p></div></div></a><div class="fc_cal_mini"><div class="na_card_wrp na_ccw_wrp" data-priority=""><a class="na_ccw tc r_img" url="https://www.msn.com/en-us/news/other/bill-gates-warns-ai-could-cause-a-billion-deaths/ar-AA2d8off?ocid=BingNewsVerp" titletext="Bill Gates warns AI could ’cause a billion deaths’" href="https://www.msn.com/en-us/news/other/bill-gates-warns-ai-could-cause-a-billion-deaths/ar-AA2d8off?ocid=BingNewsVerp" h="ID=news,5095.1"><div class="citm_img"><div class="imagewrap"><img tabindex="-1" data-src-hq="/th?id=ONUT.404gZ8U5h4P2qrJBezYJdA&amp;pid=News&amp;w=94&amp;h=94&amp;c=14&amp;rs=2&amp;qlt=90" data-priority="2" role="presentation" width="94" height="94" aria-hidden="true" class="rms_img" loading="lazy" src="/th?id=ONUT.404gZ8U5h4P2qrJBezYJdA&pid=News&w=94&h=94&c=14&rs=2&qlt=30" /></div></div><div class="b_cap citm_cap invalid_footer_link"><div class="caption ns_pub_area cap_top" data-priority="2"><div class="caption_img"><img title="News Nation on MSN" width="16" height="16" class="pubimg rms_img" id="emb267CD2EE7" loading="lazy" src="/th?id=ODF.npGlUre2FIm6XIGHjCyFaQ&pid=news&w=16&h=16&c=14&rs=2" /></div><cite title="News Nation on MSN"><span class="cap_title">News Nation on MSN</span><span class="cap_txt">&nbsp;&#0183;&#32;7h</span></cite></div><div class="na_cal_title na_t b_promtxt">Bill Gates warns AI could ’cause a billion deaths’</div></div></a></div><div class="na_card_wrp na_ccw_wrp" data-priority=""><a class="na_ccw tc r_img" url="https://www.usatoday.com/story/tech/2026/09/27/bill-gates-ai-safeguards-self-regulation/91980659007/" titletext="Bill Gates backs AI safeguards, says self-regulation isn't enough" href="https://www.usatoday.com/story/tech/2026/09/27/bill-gates-ai-safeguards-self-regulation/91980659007/" h="ID=news,5097.1"><div class="citm_img"><div class="imagewrap"><img tabindex="-1" data-src-hq="/th?id=ONUT.utHxFyuEebWwcB818fhQ6g&amp;pid=News&amp;w=94&amp;h=94&amp;c=14&amp;rs=2&amp;qlt=90" data-priority="2" role="presentation" width="94" height="94" aria-hidden="true" class="rms_img" loading="lazy" src="/th?id=ONUT.utHxFyuEebWwcB818fhQ6g&pid=News&w=94&h=94&c=14&rs=2&qlt=30" /></div></div><div class="b_cap citm_cap invalid_footer_link"><div class="big_logo"><div class="big_pub_logo ns_pub_area cap_top" data-priority="2"><cite title="USA TODAY"><div class="caption_img"><img title="USA TODAY" width="33" height="12" class="pubimg rms_img" id="emb30708F0F3" loading="lazy" src="/th?id=OJ.IUEbmQ1Xm0fwOA&pid=news&w=33&h=12&rs=2" /></div><span class="cap_txt">&nbsp;&#0183;&#32;2d</span></cite></div></div><div class="na_cal_title na_t b_promtxt">Bill Gates backs AI safeguards, says self-regulation isn't enough</div></div></a></div></div></div><div class="fc_cal_item fc_largeleft"><a class="ns-hero-link largeleft" url="https://www.reuters.com/legal/litigation/bill-gates-joins-calls-ai-safeguards-including-legislation-2026-09-27/" target="_blank" aria-label="Bill Gates joins calls for AI safeguards, including legislation" href="https://www.reuters.com/legal/litigation/bill-gates-joins-calls-ai-safeguards-including-legislation-2026-09-27/" h="ID=news,5099.1"><div class="hero-img"><div class="citm_img" style="height: 200px;" tabindex="-1"><div class="rms_iac" style="height:200px;line-height:200px;width:367px;" data-title="Bill Gates joins calls for AI safeguards, including legislation" data-width="367" data-height="200" data-data-priority="2" data-class="rms_img" data-src="//th.bing.com/th?id=ONUT.xZltipEJt3Rsy9bl3Le58A&amp;pid=News&amp;w=367&amp;h=200&amp;c=14&amp;rs=2&amp;qlt=90"></div></div></div><div class="word-part"><div class="publisher-part"><div class="big_logo"><div class="big_pub_logo ns_pub_area cap_top" data-priority="2"><cite title="Reuters"><div class="caption_img"><img title="Reuters" width="50" height="12" class="pubimg rms_img" id="emb41548755A" loading="lazy" src="/th?id=OJ.QqYuZxDqP81h5g&pid=news&w=50&h=12&rs=2" /></div><span class="cap_txt">&nbsp;&#0183;&#32;1d</span></cite></div></div></div><div class="na_t news_title">Bill Gates joins calls for AI safeguards, including legislation</div><div class="key-point">AI requires safeguards that go beyond self-regulation, Microsoft co-founder Bill Gates said in an interview that aired on Sunday, calling for legislation to be passed ​in Congress.</div><div class="fc_prompt"><div class="bottom_chevron_bac"></div><p>Continue reading</p></div></div></a><div class="fc_cal_mini"><div class="na_card_wrp na_ccw_wrp" data-priority=""><a class="na_ccw tc r_img" url="https://www.realclearpolitics.com/video/2026/09/27/bill_gates_ai_could_be_more_difficult_to_contain_than_nuclear_weapons_could_kill_a_billion_people.html" titletext="Bill Gates on AI: &quot;No One Thinks Self-Regulation Is Enough&quot;--We Need Legislation" href="https://www.realclearpolitics.com/video/2026/09/27/bill_gates_ai_could_be_more_difficult_to_contain_than_nuclear_weapons_could_kill_a_billion_people.html" h="ID=news,5101.1"><div class="citm_img"><div class="imagewrap"><div class="rms_iac" style="height:94px;line-height:94px;width:94px;" data-width="94" data-height="94" data-data-priority="2" data-aria-hidden="true" data-role="presentation" data-class="rms_img" data-src="//th.bing.com/th?id=ONUT.tkDZaQNN4rRJsz9G0SFveA&amp;pid=News&amp;w=94&amp;h=94&amp;c=14&amp;rs=2&amp;qlt=90"></div></div></div><div class="b_cap citm_cap invalid_footer_link"><div class="big_logo"><div class="big_pub_logo ns_pub_area cap_top" data-priority="2"><cite title="RealClearPolitics"><div class="caption_img"><img title="RealClearPolitics" width="47" height="12" class="pubimg rms_img" id="emb56C43C6CC" loading="lazy" src="/th?id=OJ.sqFQf08HmU8DCQ&pid=news&w=47&h=12&rs=2" /></div><span class="cap_txt">&nbsp;&#0183;&#32;2d</span></cite></div></div><div class="na_cal_title na_t b_promtxt">Bill Gates on AI: &quot;No One Thinks Self-Regulation Is Enough&quot;--We Need Legislation</div></div></a></div><div class="na_card_wrp na_ccw_wrp" data