lass="rms_img" data-src="//th.bing.com/th?id=ONUT.5H1cAassl0-gvilzT-5BLg&amp;pid=News&amp;w=367&amp;h=200&amp;c=14&amp;rs=2&amp;qlt=90"></div></div></div><div class="word-part"><div class="publisher-part"><div class="news_footer ns_pub_area morespace"><div class="publogo nowrap" data-priority="2"><img tabindex="-1" data-src-hq="/th?id=ODF.Rkysmqmji5ZsYxsH8QdPQA&amp;pid=news&amp;w=16&amp;h=16&amp;c=14&amp;rs=2" data-priority="2" title="KTXS" width="16" height="16" class="pubimg rms_img" id="emb702E33D14" loading="lazy" src="/th?id=ODF.Rkysmqmji5ZsYxsH8QdPQA&pid=news&w=16&h=16&c=14&rs=2&qlt=30" /><cite title="KTXS"><span class="na_footer_name">KTXS</span><span class="b_secondaryText">&nbsp;&#0183;&#32;1d</span></cite></div></div></div><div class="na_t news_title">Bill Gates warns AI could be used to trigger 'a billion deaths,' urges regulation</div><div class="key-point">President Donald Trump has publicly pushed back on additional AI guardrails, while congressional leaders have not yet advanced major federal AI legislation.</div><div class="fc_prompt"><div class="bottom_chevron_bac"></div><p>Continue reading</p></div></div></a><div class="fc_cal_mini"><div class="na_card_wrp na_ccw_wrp" data-priority=""><a class="na_ccw tc r_img" url="https://www.yahoo.com/news/videos/bill-gates-says-ai-could-204624974.html" titletext="Bill Gates says AI could cause 'a billion deaths' without regulation" href="https://www.yahoo.com/news/videos/bill-gates-says-ai-could-204624974.html" h="ID=news,5107.1"><div class="citm_img"><div class="imagewrap"><div class="rms_iac" style="height:94px;line-height:94px;width:94px;" data-width="94" data-height="94" data-data-priority="2" data-aria-hidden="true" data-role="presentation" data-class="rms_img" data-src="//th.bing.com/th?id=ONUT.ttFpCX6_TS93D89db_PwuQ&amp;pid=News&amp;w=94&amp;h=94&amp;c=14&amp;rs=2&amp;qlt=90"></div></div></div><div class="b_cap citm_cap invalid_footer_link"><div class="big_logo"><div class="big_pub_logo ns_pub_area cap_t