:none"><div class="fc_tab active">Top News</div><div class="fc_tab ">Overview</div></div><div class="right_arrow"><div class="arrow_img"></div></div><div class="left_arrow hide"><div class="arrow_img"></div></div><div class="fc_cal_ct"><div class="fc_cal"><div class="fc_cal_item fc_largeleft"><a class="ns-hero-link largeleft" url="https://www.msn.com/en-us/technology/artificial-intelligence/nvidia-launches-new-safety-program-after-ai-regulation-uproar/ar-AA2d8pRz?ocid=BingNewsVerp" target="_blank" aria-label="Nvidia launches new safety program after AI regulation uproar" href="https://www.msn.com/en-us/technology/artificial-intelligence/nvidia-launches-new-safety-program-after-ai-regulation-uproar/ar-AA2d8pRz?ocid=BingNewsVerp" h="ID=news,5117.1"><div class="hero-img"><div class="citm_img" style="height: 200px;" tabindex="-1"><img tabindex="-1" data-src-hq="/th?id=ONUT.N4A6e7a54dBHt6_P4gJK0Q&amp;pid=News&amp;w=367&amp;h=200&amp;c=14&amp;rs=2&amp;qlt=90" data-priority="2" title="Nvidia launches new safety program after AI regulation uproar" width="367" height="200" id="embA0B04B7C9" class="rms_img" loading="lazy" src="/th?id=ONUT.N4A6e7a54dBHt6_P4gJK0Q&pid=News&w=367&h=200&c=14&rs=2&qlt=30" /></div></div><div class="word-part"><div class="publisher-part"><div class="big_logo"><div class="big_pub_logo ns_pub_area cap_top" data-priority="2"><cite title="Washington Examiner on MSN"><div class="caption_img"><img title="Washington Examiner on MSN" width="76" height="12" class="pubimg rms_img" id="embB75D80D1A" loading="lazy" src="/th?id=OJ.CXwIpKlXtOOR9A&pid=news&w=76&h=12&rs=2" /></div><span class="cap_txt">&nbsp;&#0183;&#32;7h<span>&nbsp;&#0183;&#32;on MSN</span></span></cite></div></div></div><div class="na_t news_title">Nvidia launches new safety program after AI regulation uproar</div><div class="key-point">Nvidia launched a new safety program on Monday that is designed to shut down rogue artificial intelligence models. The advanced chipmaker’s Open Agent Safety Platform comes after recent incidents in which autonomous agents hacked certain companies and websites.</div><div class="fc_prompt"><div class="bottom_chevron_bac"></div><p>Continue reading</p></div></div></a><div class="fc_cal_mini"><div class="na_card_wrp na_ccw_wrp" data-priority=""><a class="na_ccw tc r_img" url="https://www.msn.com/en-us/news/other/nvidia-launches-security-platform-to-keep-ai-agents-from-going-rogue/ar-AA2d8Buk?ocid=BingNewsVerp" titletext="Nvidia launches security platform to keep AI agents from going rogue" href="https://www.msn.com/en-us/news/other/nvidia-launches-security-platform-to-keep-ai-agents-from-going-rogue/ar-AA2d8Buk?ocid=BingNewsVerp" h="ID=news,5119.1"><div class="b_cap citm_cap invalid_footer_link"><div class="big_logo"><div class="big_pub_logo ns_pub_area cap_top" data-priority="2"><cite title="Fox Business on MSN"><div class="caption_img"><img title="Fox Business on MSN" width="22" height="12" class="pubimg rms_img" id="embC7BEE8692" loading="lazy" src="/th?id=OJ.7ccdFvRWaWZinQ&pid=news&w=22&h=12&rs=2" /></div><span class="cap_txt">&nbsp;&#0183;&#32;5h<span>&nbsp;&#0183;&#32;on MSN</span></span></cite></div></div><div class="na_cal_title na_t b_promtxt">Nvidia launches security platform to keep AI agents from going rogue</div></div></a></div><div class="na_card_wrp na_ccw_wrp" data-priority=""><a class="na_ccw tc r_img" url="https://www.msn.com/en-us/technology/artificial-intelligence/nvidia-announces-security-system-to-stop-ai-agents-from-going-rogue/ar-AA2d7dDW?ocid=BingNewsVerp" titletext="Nvidia announces security system to stop AI agents from going rogue" href="https://www.msn.com/en-us/technology/artificial-intelligence/nvidia-announces-security-system-to-stop-ai-agents-from-going-rogue/ar-AA2d7dDW?ocid=BingNewsVerp" h="ID=news,5121.1"><div class="citm_img"><div class="imagewrap"><img tabindex="-1" data-src-hq="/th?id=ONUT.B4yTK2dXjrzh2bOonzVNVg&amp;pid=News&amp;w=94&amp;h=94&amp;c=14&amp;rs=2&amp;qlt=90" data-priority="2" role="presentation" width="94" height="94" aria-hidden="true" class="rms_img" loading="lazy" src="/th?id=ONUT.B4yTK2dXjrzh2bOonzVNVg&pid=News&w=94&h=94&c=14&rs=2&qlt=30" /></div></div><div class="b_cap citm_cap invalid_footer_link"><div class="big_logo"><div class="big_pub_logo ns_pub_area cap_top" data-priority="2"><cite title="CBS News on MSN"><div class="caption_img"><img title="CBS News on MSN" width="65" height="12" class="pubimg rms_img" id="embD6CFDB935" loading="lazy" src="/th?id=OJ.8MmhhQ3g034d0g&pid=news&w=65&h=12&rs=2" /></div><span class="cap_txt">&nbsp;&#0183;&#32;11h<span>&nbsp;&#0183;&#32;on MSN</span></span></cite></div></div><div class="na_cal_title na_t b_promtxt">Nvidia announces security system to stop AI agents from going rogue</div></div></a></div></div></div><div class="fc_cal_item fc_largeleft"><a class="ns-hero-link largeleft" url="https://au.finance.yahoo.com/news/nvidia-introduces-ai-security-system-144704150.html" target="_blank" aria-label="Nvidia introduces AI security system to ‘set boundaries’ and stop rogue agents" href="https://au.finance.yahoo.com/news/nvidia-introduces-ai-security-system-144704150.html" h="ID=news,5123.1"><div class="hero-img"><div class="citm_img" style="height: 200px;" tabindex="-1"><div class="rms_iac" style="height:200px;line-height:200px;width:367px;" data-title="Nvidia introduces AI security system to ‘set boundaries’ and stop rogue agents" data-width="367" data-height="200" data-data-priority="2" data-class="rms_img" data-src="//th.bing.com/th?id=ONUT.9ZqKnqWAr_3-bV2SrXs-0Q&amp;pid=News&amp;w=367&amp;h=200&amp;c=14&amp;rs=2&amp;qlt=90"></div></div></div><div class="word-part"><div class="publisher-part"><div class="big_logo"><div class="big_pub_logo ns_pub_area cap_top" data-priority="2"><cite title="Yahoo Finance"><div class="caption_img"><img title="Yahoo Finance" width="75" height="12" class="pubimg rms_img" id="embE2158CDE1" loading="lazy" src="/th?id=OJ.ykmRPkks0lGk5A&pid=news&w=75&h=12&rs=2" /></div><